  "summary_en": "UNESCO's global Recommendation on the Ethics of AI, adopted November 2021. It sets values, principles and eleven policy areas grounded in human rights and dignity, covering impact assessment, governance, data, environment, gender, education and more. It is voluntary soft law with only passing mention of robotics.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Sets values and principles: human rights, proportionality, safety, fairness, privacy, human oversight, transparency, accountability, sustainability",
